Changes made by AtlasSend
-------------------------

- The app is renamed to "AtlasSend" and uses its own identifiers and settings
  location, so it can be installed next to the original LocalSend.
- A transparent overlay window on Windows shows incoming files as cards.
- New code lives under app/lib/atlassend/ and in the files prefixed with
  "atlas_" in app/windows/runner/.

AtlasSend stays compatible with the LocalSend protocol and is not affiliated
with or endorsed by the LocalSend project.
